WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
The label on a bottle of orange
squash says: mix one to four.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.850
One cup of squash, then
four cups of water.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.130
You stir it in a big jug.

4
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.630
Now look at the jug.

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.490
What fraction of the drink is squash?

6
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.190
One to four sounds like one quarter.

7
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.490
But is it?

8
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.210
In this mission, you'll
change between units,

9
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.950
like metres and kilometres.

10
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.040
You'll read the scale on a
map and find real distances.

11
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:31.290
And you'll simplify ratios
and share amounts in a ratio.

12
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.540
Your mission: work out what
fraction of the jug is squash.
